/S /P
/E (SPASE offers postgraduate and doctoral programs, along with a minor for undergraduates, and promotes interdisciplinary learning at the intersection of science and engineering. Key research areas include planetary science, astrophysics, multi-wavelength astronomy, remote sensing, and space instrumentation.)
/Pg 11 0 R
